sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant App as Time Tracker (browser)
    participant LS as localStorage
    participant API as Productive API

    U->>App: Enter API token + organization ID
    Note over App,API: include=person,organization is mandatory: without it neither<br/>relationship carries data, and no ID at all
    App->>API: GET /organization_memberships?include=person,organization
    alt 401 invalid_auth_token
        API-->>App: errors[]
        App-->>U: "Invalid API token."
    else 403 no_person
        API-->>App: errors[]
        App-->>U: "This token is not a member of organization N."
    else network error
        App-->>U: "Network error. Try again."
    else 200
        API-->>App: every membership this token owns
        Note over App,API: X-Organization-Id does not scope the collection: an unknown<br/>organization is answered 200 with the token's own memberships
        App->>App: find the membership whose organization matches the entered ID<br/>(assignment, page 2)
        alt no membership matches
            App-->>U: "This token is not a member of organization N."
        else matched
            App->>App: read person from that membership
            Note over App,API: /services is organization-wide, and a person_id<br/>filter there is silently ignored (A-1)
            App->>LS: save { token, organizationId, personId, personName }
            App-)API: prefetch GET /services (not awaited, A-1)
            App-->>U: redirect to /day/today
        end
    end

    Note over App,LS: On refresh: read LS, re-validate with one GET, and check the<br/>stored organization and person still match what it answers
    U->>App: Logout
    App->>LS: clear key
    App->>App: clear query cache, redirect /login
